          <argument>
            <kind>1</kind>
            <string>/// QUEUE OUR EFFECT
// Plague Of Rats
// Create a new Black Rat every turn. If no free card slots exist to 
// summon a Black Rat, choose a cardslot to empty. Send anything on that
// cardslot to the graveyard and place a Black Rat in its place.

